              "title": "Observational design lacks any confounder control or treatment-assignment description",
              "evidenceRefs": [
                "manuscript.md"
              ],
              "whyItMatters": "Without documentation of how treatment was assigned, whether there was randomization or which confounders were measured, the mean difference cannot be attributed to the treatment. Observational studies require at least a discussion of potential confounding, if not formal adjustment.",
