                "stats-run.json (only means, no SDs)"
              ],
              "whyItMatters": "Standard deviations are needed to judge variability, effect size, and potential outliers.",
              "actionableFix": "Include standard deviations for each group alongside the means, and consider adding the pooled SD or group-specific SDs.",
              "reentryPoint": "manuscript",
              "deterministicVerification": null,
              "confidence": 1
            },
            {
